&lt;p&gt;Built a sourcing function from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sourced for other kinds of hardware, such as robotics or manufacturing equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
